AfraKala API work is contract-first.

Canonical contract file: automation/openapi/automation-v1.yaml

Before API-related work, read the canonical contract, check endpoint and schemas, update the contract first when missing, validate with Redocly, then implement after review.

Validation command:
npx --yes @redocly/cli lint automation/openapi/automation-v1.yaml

Do not use root openapi/ for YAML contract files.

Order: Contract, Implementation, UI, Production.
